flowchart TD
  Browser[React browser client] -->|GET + credentialed API| API[Express API]
  Browser -->|POST/PATCH/DELETE + trusted Origin + X-ReserveUrTime-Request| API
  API --> Auth[JWT cookie + current User + authVersion]
  Auth --> RBAC{Role / Restaurant scope}
  RBAC --> Customer[Customer services]
  RBAC --> Platform[Platform Admin services]
  RBAC --> RestAdmin[Restaurant Admin services]
  Customer --> Mongo[(MongoDB Atlas)]
  Platform --> Mongo
  RestAdmin --> Mongo
  RestAdmin --> Safe3D[Bounded 3D animation config]
  Safe3D --> Mongo

  Phase10[Phase 10 SSLCOMMERZ implemented after gate] --> PayInit[Authenticated payment initiation]
  PayInit -. server-authoritative Order total .-> SSL[SSLCOMMERZ Sandbox]
  SSL -. IPN / callback .-> VerifiedRoute[Dedicated gateway callback]
  VerifiedRoute -. validation API + amount/currency/transaction match .-> Mongo

  note1[Do NOT exempt ordinary browser mutations from CSRF/origin controls]
  note1 -.-> VerifiedRoute
